Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:52:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Append pickup observations to open incidents

Repeated pickup firings reuse open detector subjects and append evidence, with identical comment replay suppressed. Closed incidents no longer suppress new firings. Preserve decimal alarm identity and source exclusion. WIP for self-work D: state companion and remaining producer audit not finished.
